repository-code: 'https://github.com/StarDust1508/ScArlet-Sails'
url: 'https://github.com/StarDust1508/ScArlet-Sails'
abstract: >-
  An 8-month retail algorithmic trading research project that
  conducted an honest multi-market walk-forward audit of rule-based
  technical strategies. 131 walk-forward windows across 14
  cryptocurrencies and 4 precious metals, 5 strategy classes,
  rigorous Deflated Sharpe Ratio and Probability of Backtest
  Overfitting corrections. Negative central finding: no
  generalizable out-of-sample edge from simple technical
  strategies in the tested universe. Repository includes a
  reproducible toolkit (vectorbt-based backtest engine, free-data
  fetchers, statistical correction implementations) and serves as
  a research baseline and educational artifact rather than a
  production trading system.
